      "title": "DEFY vs UNDERGROUND",
      "text": "DEFY is the better fit for energy, while UNDERGROUND is the better fit for energy.\nAlpha GPC: DEFY 600 mg; UNDERGROUND 300 mg.\nCholine Bitartrate: DEFY 600 mg; UNDERGROUND 200 mg.\nN-Acetyl L-Tyrosine: DEFY 500 mg; UNDERGROUND 250 mg.\nCaffeine Anhydrous: DEFY 300 mg; UNDERGROUND 350 mg.\nL-Theanine: DEFY 100 mg; UNDERGROUND 150 mg.\nMucuna Pruriens: DEFY 50 mg; UNDERGROUND 70 mg.\nOnly DEFY discloses: L-Citrulline: 10 g per 2 scoops; Betaine Anhydrous: 5 g per 2 scoops; L-Tyrosine: 1 g per 2 scoops; Dendrobium Extract: 600 mg per 2 scoops; Bitter Orange Extract: 120 mg per 2 scoops; Cafe Alatus: 100 mg per 2 scoops; Dicaffeine Malate: 75 mg per 2 scoops; BioPerine: 5 mg per 2 scoops.\nOnly UNDERGROUND discloses: Citrulline Malate: 7 g per full serving; Taurine: 1000 mg per full serving; Dendrobium Extract 10:1: 600 mg per full serving; Sodium Bicarbonate: 500 mg per full serving; Juniper Berry: 150 mg per full serving; Theobromine: 150 mg per full serving; AstraGin: 25 mg per full serving.\nDEFY caffeine: DEFY officially lists 450 mg total caffeine per 2 scoops (27.19 g); 1-scoop option also shown. UNDERGROUND caffeine: UNDERGROUND officially lists 350 mg total caffeine per 1 scoop (17.04 g).\nDEFY: DEFY: A hyper-stimulant pre-workout positioned around intense energy, pump, and performance. The easiest concrete points are 450 mg official total caffeine at two scoops, 10 g L-Citrulline, 5 g Betaine. UNDERGROUND: UNDERGROUND: A high-stimulant pre-workout with a broad disclosed focus and performance formula. The easiest concrete points are 350 mg caffeine, 7 g Citrulline Malate, 3.2 g Beta-Alanine.\nMatch the recommendation to the buyer’s primary goal: DEFY for energy; UNDERGROUND for energy.",
