      "title": "CUTS vs TONE",
      "text": "CUTS is the more aggressive general thermogenic pre-workout; TONE is the women-positioned weight-management formula with a broader antioxidant and CLA story.\nChromium: CUTS 144 mcg; TONE 116 mcg.\nSodium: CUTS 20 mg; TONE 10 mg.\nOnly CUTS discloses: Vitamin C: 50 mg per full serving; Agmatine Sulfate: inside Fat Burning Matrix; individual amount not disclosed; Acetyl L-Carnitine HCl: inside Fat Burning Matrix; individual amount not disclosed; Mucuna Pruriens: inside Fat Burning Matrix; individual amount not disclosed; Evodiamine: inside Fat Burning Matrix; individual amount not disclosed.\nOnly TONE discloses: Theobromine: inside Energy Focus Blend; individual amount not disclosed; L-Theanine: inside Energy Focus Blend; individual amount not disclosed; Vitamin B12: inside Energy Focus Blend; individual amount not disclosed; CLA: inside Weight Loss/Antioxidant Blend; individual amount not disclosed; L-Citrulline Malate: inside Weight Loss/Antioxidant Blend; individual amount not disclosed; Eleutherococcus Senticosus: inside Weight Loss/Antioxidant Blend; individual amount not disclosed; Green Coffee Bean Extract: inside Weight Loss/Antioxidant Blend; individual amount not disclosed; Green Tea Extract: inside Weight Loss/Antioxidant Blend; individual amount not disclosed.\nCUTS caffeine: CUTS officially lists 300 mg total caffeine per 1 scoop (8 g). TONE caffeine: TONE officially lists 300 mg total caffeine per 1 scoop (9 g).\nBoth disclose 300 mg caffeine and use proprietary blends. CUTS is built around its Fat Burning Matrix and a direct thermogenic-pre-workout experience. TONE divides the label into an Energy Focus Blend and a Weight Loss/Antioxidant Blend with CLA, carnitine, citrulline malate, green coffee, green tea, fruit extracts, vitamins, and minerals.\nChoose CUTS for the established, direct thermogenic pre-workout sale. Choose TONE when the buyer wants women-oriented weight-management positioning, CLA, vitamins, and antioxidant ingredients—while being clear that most individual blend dosages are not disclosed.",
